# .cpanel.yml deploys everything tracked here with cp -R, so raw phone photos, design
# working files and full-size originals must never be committed. Only the resized site
# copies (assets/products/slides/, assets/flora/flora-about.jpg, the .webp images) ship.
assets/PXL_*
assets/products/*.jpg

# Kept on this computer only (already replaced on the site by the .webp versions, or never used)
logo-design/
assets/Oc Flora.png
assets/appie.png
assets/kitten front and side view.png
assets/mama and kitten.png
assets/photo-frame.png
assets/plushie-kitten-views.png
assets/plushie-mama-and-kitten.png
assets/oc-appie.png
assets/mascot-flora.png
